        "raw": "I'm not usually a big fan of the \"Random Chart of Randomness\" craze that dominates some corners of the OSR and indie RPG scene, but every now and then I see one that catches my attention instead of being yet another \"Contents of NPC Pockets\" rehash.  The [News Headlines For River City 1949 chart here](https://elfmaidsandoctopi.blogspot.com/2024/01/d100-news-headlines-river-city-1949.html) is one of those rare exceptions.  Heck of a fine inspiration for what's going on in your campaign city when you find yourself stuck for ideas.  Well worth a look.\n\nDespite the name, it would only require a few minor changes to fit in any time period, so handy outside of Golden Age too.",
